30:Tc45,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Jeddah airport from the city centre?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"King Abdulaziz International Airport (JED) is about 20 km from central Jeddah — ~30 min on a clear road. Hotels in the far north (Obhur) are closer; Al-Balad in the south is further."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you track my flight if it is delayed?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Share your flight number when you book and we track the flight, so a delay moves your pickup. 15–30 minutes of waiting after landing is free."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best way to get from Jeddah Airport to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For most visitors, a pre-booked private car: about 80 km and ~1 hr from your terminal to your Makkah hotel, with all your luggage in one vehicle. The Haramain train is faster in motion but runs station to station, so you still need a car at the Makkah end."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long is the drive from Jeddah to Madinah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 420 km — ~4 hr of driving, longer with the prayer and rest stops you ask for. From JED airport it is about 410 km."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the driver take us to our Makkah hotel door?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The driver takes you as close to your hotel as vehicles are permitted. Near the Haram some roads close at peak times, and the driver uses the nearest allowed drop-off point."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I hire a car with driver in Jeddah for a day?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Book a private driver by the hour or for a full day; the car waits between stops. It suits sightseeing across Al-Balad and the Corniche, a day of meetings, or a long shopping day."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a private transfer in Jeddah cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The fare depends on the route, vehicle, date and any waiting time. It is quoted per trip and agreed before booking — one fixed price, no meter, no surge."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What vehicle should a family with luggage book?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A full-size SUV takes up to seven passengers with several large cases; a VIP van or a coaster suits larger families and groups. A sedan fits one to three people with normal luggage."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel or change a booking?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Cancellation is free up to 24 hours before pickup, and changes to time or address can be made on WhatsApp."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can my company be invoiced?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company. Email your company details and trip list for a written quote before booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do the drivers speak English?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Drivers in our Jeddah partner network speak English and Arabic, and trips run 24 hours a day."}}]}29:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$30"}}]
